uttons", "created_at": "2023-04-03T14:37:06Z", "repo": "dislate", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "48b9f8477973f8c4d6ac58b4e98b8ae2549725c1", "message": "Version 1.4.0 ~ Build 8e8ef514\n\nChanges and additions:\n~ Remove unused imports\n~ Remove left-over comments\n~ Structure the Format.string method a bit better", "created_at": "2023-04-03T14:31:50Z", "repo": "dislate", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c850f084e2d5765c0db6997b8b0006c1857ef644", "message": "Update bundle to b44b4f9f", "created_at": "2023-04-03T14:23:27Z", "repo": "dislate", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6594e75cffca65a5472309d85051e8d46c737e98", "message": "Version 1.4.0 ~ Build b44b4f9f\n\nChanges and additions:\n~ Push the leading slightly back if the subLabel or label overflows\nThis effectively reverses discord's changes in 164+.", "created_at": "2023-04-03T14:22:41Z", "repo": "dislate", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e4c6ac26d87a37af834457ebfcb6ed28cc4eb8d4", "message": "Version 1.4.0 ~ Build 6acf148f\n\nChanges and additions:\n~ Major Refactor :3\n~ Properly type all components\n~ Remove all comments\n~ Remove array_methods.ts, not required\n~ Remove devices.ts, too much code for little reward\n~ Use proper i18n locale for button index\n~ Move component styles into their own Component.styles.ts file\n~ Remove Format.object as thats no longer required.\n~ Rename commands to TS (.tsx -> .ts) as no tsx is used inside of them.\n~ Use common Clipboard module\n~ Conform SectionWrapper to use React's reserved `children` prop\n~ Move FormRows that control the language chosen out main Settings page\n\nDue to all of these changes, the bundle size has reduced to 40kb!", "created_at": "2023-04-03T14:18:54Z", "repo": "dislate", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "58817c60d7b4f8